        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">被动：</span>嘉文获得<span>20/22.5/25/27.5/30%攻击速度</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">主动：</span>嘉文将一面军旗投掷到地上，造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/120/160/200/240 + (80% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>并为附近的友军们提供持续8秒的<span>20/22.5/25/27.5/30%攻击速度</span>。",
